==Strategy==
Trying to beat Nimoy Bore with only special units is next to impossible. The only way to clear the stage is to destroy the base before he even spawns.

==='''Strategy 1 (Cheese)'''===
{{Lineup
|Crazed Cat
|Crazed Tank Cat
|Crazed Axe Cat
|Crazed Gross Cat
|Crazed Cow Cat
|Riceball Cat
|Awakened Bahamut Cat|30
|name = Lineup 1
|cannon = Any
|notes = The Crazy Hearts Cat Combo can be replaced with any Starting Money combos that add up to 1000c or more.
}}

'''Battle:''' Make sure to '''not''' upgrade your wallet at all, and just wait. Spawn Awakened Bahamut once you have the money then spam Riceball Cat. This works in all 3 chapters, no hypermaxxing or talents needed on any unit. However the timing in chapter 3 is extremely tight, so bringing an additional rusher such as [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]] or [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] can make this strategy more reliable. If you don't own Riceball Cat, [[Li'l Cow Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Cow Cat]] can substitute it, but make sure to use the first form for the lower cooldown.

